        "Description": "Good Morning 47, Ether Biotech’s DNA-specific virus poses an active global threat. ICA command requires a synchronized, total wipe of the Sapienza project. Your targets are Silvio Caruso, Francesca De Santis, and the lead scientists holding the core research data. The ICA wants them completely off the map. Erase the minds behind the operation to guarantee this bioweapon can never be reconstructed. Ether Biotech’s DNA-specific virus poses an active global threat.  Best of luck 47.",
